<title>USA: Experimental U.S. CPI index tables.</title>
<headline>Experimental U.S. CPI index tables.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Labor Department on Thursday released historical data on its new experimental price gauge, the geometric mean index.</p>
<p>Below are comparisons between the experimental index, a test index using a similar formula to the official Consumer Price Index and the CPI itself.</p>
