<p>Unlike the official Consumer Price Index, the geometric mean formula takes into account consumers' tendency to substitute among similar items.</p>
<p>The test index uses the same mathematical formula as the official CPI but with a technical adjustment for certain price quotations to make it comparable to the geometric mean index.</p>
